  "text": "Containment Zone Four. The checkpoints are sealed. Families are trapped between the fires and the membrane. At the dojo, they tried to erase the past. Here, they are deciding who gets a future. Siege units deploying heavy plasma mortars. Evacuation route at risk. Three biometric spires sustain the barrier. Reach the compound and disable them. The evacuation route must stay open. Then we give them a road out. No one gets left behind because a machine denied them passage. Follow the evacuation road. Local resistance signals are active ahead. I'm moving.",
